            <ArticleTitle>Myocardial revascularization: surgery or stenting?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>264-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is current debate regarding the relative merits and roles of surgical revascularization and percutaneous revascularization for patients with obstructive coronary artery disease. This article reviews the current literature relating to this subject.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
